    "body": "Closes #35101\r\n\r\n## Problem\r\n\r\n`:terminal` renders OSC 8 hyperlinks, but nothing can retrieve them (cannot navigate, etc.).\r\n\r\n## Solution\r\n\r\nImplement OSC 8 with extmarks. The terminal interns each URL and keeps an index of it on the vterm cell (dangit, this will have to be redone with libghostty). A link that wraps is a single mark that spans the corresponding mulitple rows.\r\n\r\n***Do not enable navigation. See #40896 for that***\r\n\r\n",
    "closed_at": "2026-08-05T08:36:11Z",
    "comment_data": [],
    "comment_regular_data": [
